Third-party material adopted
============================

MPFever
-------

  Project:   MPFever, an independent multiplayer research project for Transport Fever 3
  URL:       https://github.com/dkdknight/MPFever
  Licence:   MIT
  Studied:   commit ae5fc96
  Adopted:   engine and runtime behaviour notes, API catalogue entries and game-mechanics facts, paraphrased
             and tagged `[ADOPTED: ...]` with an `MPF:<file>` source citation. They are the author's
             statements, not verified by this project unless a topic says so.
  Used in:   src/tf3companion/knowledge/engine.md, api_catalog.md, mechanics.md and cargo_economy.md,
             and the troubleshooting guide's "Game files, logs and crashes" section.

